{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Save the Universe with your movement!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to be agile and precise, but don't worry... you've got this.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemies and Somber Slumber at all costs! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find up to 350 pieces of scattered Dough and 105 planetoids in your quest to discover outer space's every nook and cranny. Other secrets also await.<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/0a7a89d0bc023502b3ce9a5dcb3ed214.poster.avif?t=1746468651\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/0a7a89d0bc023502b3ce9a5dcb3ed214.webm?t=1746468651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/0a7a89d0bc023502b3ce9a5dcb3ed214.mp4?t=1746468651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside hypnotic pixel art graphics and a dazzlingly atmospheric soundtrack, BeDo offers an immersive, fun and challenging experience.     </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It's both accessible and tough. Everyone can start and progress in the adventure, but exploring every corner of the universe won't be an easy task. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax gliding across mysterious galaxies\u2026 or dashing quickly to the golden goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/3911cd400d5bde274727f6873e2c9dc1.poster.avif?t=1746468651\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/3911cd400d5bde274727f6873e2c9dc1.webm?t=1746468651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/3911cd400d5bde274727f6873e2c9dc1.mp4?t=1746468651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><i>BeDo is a unique game, difficult to classify \u2014and it feels refreshingly simple at its core: move a mysterious dough through the universe. How well can you control your spatial slides? Can you lead BeDo to the goal in every level?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/588a4e6a9185a90e24bc46b84a3f2a01.poster.avif?t=1746468651\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/588a4e6a9185a90e24bc46b84a3f2a01.webm?t=1746468651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/588a4e6a9185a90e24bc46b84a3f2a01.mp4?t=1746468651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control BeDo in full precision: lead him in all directions as you float through space </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 handcrafted colorful levels teeming with collectibles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge Evil: Skill and precision are paramount to sort and avoid obstacles, enemies and traps in your path </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Dough of Vital Creation that was scattered throughout the Universe </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secret areas and unlock valuable secrets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A galactic, nostalgic and intriguing soundtrack</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Determined Dough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2325340/81ca9928ab9fb1b6957b715ff75173cc99696a9a.jpg"},{"name":"Beginning a Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2325340/715e68e12cdc50c25b7b80ca939737efb8c7ddfc.jpg"},{"name":"Conquered the Deeps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2325340/983219a00227f0049376c0f467e53fdcad7da8e1.jpg"},{"name":"Third World Womb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2325340/91c4ba4e2c92d94817c7abc4a56c1989f9bdb60f.jpg"},{"name":"Soaring in spite of Slumber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2325340/5dd88c5dea1a9440c71a933a034e51f672de538e.jpg"},{"name":"Shiny Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2325340/595652e95e1954153f565aaa501105b677c80d3b.jpg"},{"name":"Saving The Motherdough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2325340/622eda1b731953e9be711d1d47e0afd72149410f.jpg"},{"name":"Consolidated Motherdough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2325340/b94f736b9cf02276f7f87cc78ed3f078015b835d.jpg"},{"name":"Saved Motherdough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2325340/cb62386a9b7a17eb96dd696c8fe6386a526ecb13.jpg"},{"name":"Orbit Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2325340/f2b91046898c2a46cf0a7350e39777625af708fa.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2325340?t=1746468651","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/ed6e16b6c518589369b8acdc975ed399825b7e49/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746468651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/dfe7e76dff765eab5b60f1436b8306c299499a25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746468651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/dfe7e76dff765eab5b60f1436b8306c299499a25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746468651","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Save the Universe with your movement!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to be agile and precise, but don't worry... you've got this.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemies and Somber Slumber at all costs! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find up to 350 pieces of scattered Dough and 105 planetoids in your quest to discover outer space's every nook and cranny. Other secrets also await.<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/0a7a89d0bc023502b3ce9a5dcb3ed214.poster.avif?t=1746468651\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325340/extras/0a7a89d0bc023502b3ce9a5dcb3ed214.webm?t=1746468651\" type=\"video